        "camera" => "M23 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4l2-3h6l2 3h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v11ZM12 17a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8Z"
